+   Timer | Channel 1 | Channel 2 | Channel 3 | Channel 4
+   ------+-----------+-----------+-----------+----------
+   TIM1  |           |           |           |
+   TIM2  | --------------- PIOS_DELAY -----------------
+   TIM3  |           |           |           |
+   TIM4  |           |           |           |
+   TIM5  |           |           |           |
+   TIM6  |           |           |           |
+   TIM7  |           |           |           |
+   TIM8  |           |           |           |
+   ------+-----------+-----------+-----------+----------
+ */
+
+// ------------------------
+// DMA Channels Used
+// ------------------------
+/* Channel 1  -                                 */
+/* Channel 2  - SPI1 RX                         */
+/* Channel 3  - SPI1 TX                         */
+/* Channel 4  - SPI2 RX                         */
+/* Channel 5  - SPI2 TX                         */
+/* Channel 6  -                                 */
+/* Channel 7  -                                 */
+/* Channel 8  -                                 */
+/* Channel 9  -                                 */
+/* Channel 10 -                                 */
+/* Channel 11 -                                 */
+/* Channel 12 -                                 */
+
